   master password. You are solely responsible for:
   (a) safeguarding your master password and any recovery material; and
   (b) maintaining backups of your vault.
   LICENSOR CANNOT RECOVER YOUR DATA IF YOU LOSE YOUR MASTER PASSWORD. There is
   no backdoor and no password reset.

4. UPDATES
